flowchart LR
    subgraph GITHUB[GitHub]
      CI[Status-Page CI]
    end

    CI -->|OIDC token| STS[AWS STS]
    STS --> CIROLE[GitHub CI IAM role\nECR delivery only]
    CIROLE --> ECR[Amazon ECR]
    CIROLE -. no EKS permission .- DENY1[EKS deployment denied]

    subgraph EKS[Amazon EKS]
      SAWEB[ServiceAccount\naegis-status-page]
      SAAN[ServiceAccount\naegis-security-analyzer]
      SAEXT[ServiceAccount\naegis-external-dns]
      ARGO[Argo CD]
    end

    SAWEB -->|EKS Pod Identity| WEBROLE[Status-Page runtime/reviewer IAM role]
    WEBROLE --> RDSSEC[Exact RDS managed secret]
    WEBROLE --> DDB[(DynamoDB findings\nread/review update)]
    WEBROLE -. denied .-> SQSX[SQS]
    WEBROLE -. denied .-> BEDX[Bedrock]

    SAAN -->|EKS Pod Identity| ANROLE[Analyzer IAM role]
    ANROLE --> SQS[SQS security-events]
    ANROLE --> BED[Amazon Bedrock]
    ANROLE --> DDB2[(DynamoDB findings)]

    SAEXT --> RBAC[Kubernetes namespace RBAC]
    RBAC --> ING[Read intended Ingress]
    RBAC -. denied .-> SECRETS[Kubernetes Secret list]
    RBAC -. denied .-> DELETE[Ingress delete]

    DYNU[Dynu webhook sidecar]
    SECRET[Secret: aegis-dynu-api] --> DYNU
    SAEXT -. Kubernetes API token only mounted\ninto external-dns container .-> RBAC
    DYNU -. no Kubernetes API token .-> NONE[No cluster identity]

    ARGO -->|AppProject-constrained reconciliation| EKS

    HUMAN[Authenticated staff analyst] --> APP[AEGIS review UI]
    APP --> SAWEB
